WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.837
- Well, now it's time for our pick from

00:00:01.837 --> 00:00:02.910
"The Little Yellow Book,"

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:04.830
that's our curated list of stuff I love

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:06.120
that I always wanna share with you.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.950
We refresh it every single
week on our website.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.650
And today's pick is a greeting
card that you can grow

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.300
in the ground.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.190
Thoughtful human cards.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.540
I love these so much.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:17.960
So, they're plantable.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.340
They have seeds in them.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:20.474
And they come.

00:00:20.474 --> 00:00:21.307
- [Co-host] Aww.

00:00:21.307 --> 00:00:22.220
- [Drew] One for every occasion.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.170
I really like this one.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.510
We're all rooting for you,
it's very like, sporty.

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:28.660
And then when you're done,
you crumple it or cut it up,

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:29.493
and you stick it

00:00:29.493 --> 00:00:30.750
in some soil.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.800
And not only is it zero waste,
but then you can actually

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.114
cultivate a little life out of it.

00:00:36.114 --> 00:00:38.228
(audience clapping)
- [Co-Host] That is so cute.

00:00:38.228 --> 00:00:39.061
- I know!

00:00:39.061 --> 00:00:41.470
- I wonder if it's, this
would be great too for like a

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.543
wedding invite or something.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.376
You know what I mean-
- Yes!

00:00:44.376 --> 00:00:47.210
You could invite someone
on to your wedding.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.349
And then,
(participant laughs distantly)

00:00:48.349 --> 00:00:49.830
they could stick it
somewhere and grow something

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:50.663
out of it.
(co-host laughs)

00:00:50.663 --> 00:00:51.950
- Well, they can stick
that text somewhere,

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.069
is what they can do-
- [Drew] That's exactly right!

00:00:54.069 --> 00:00:56.652
(bright music)

